<h2 id="onlyreftdd-when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

| Trigger | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| User types **`onlyreftdd`** (often with a domain or target plan name) | Author or refresh a refactor plan **`.md`** only — **TDD chain 2**. |

**Do not implement code** under **`onlyreftdd`**. Closing reply must name the plan path and say **implement with `aciubtdd <plan.md>`** (not plain **`aciub`** / **`implref`**).

