<h2 id="onlyreftdd-delegate" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Classic delegate (required)</h2>

**Read and execute the full procedure** in:

**`.cursor/rules/onlyref-refactor-plan-author-only.mdc`** (**`onlyref`**)

That covers: plan-only boundary, folder lifecycle (`new/` only), MRKD shape, phases, `[ ]` / `[X]` checklists, forbidden actions, and baseline Quality bar.

**Non-TDD behavior lives only in the classic file.** Edit classic **`onlyref`** once when shared plan-authoring rules change; edit **this file** only when TDD planning rules change.

