<h2 id="onlyreftdd-heuristics" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. TDD mode heuristics (plan-time)</h2>

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th>Signal in phase</th><th>Plan label</th><th>Test-first?</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">New/changed contract (API, manifest, emit, pool diff, merge logic)</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><strong>strict-TDD</strong></td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Yes — red before code</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Behavioral refactor with stable external contract</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><strong>strict-TDD</strong></td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Yes — extend existing tests first</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Pure deletion (files, routes, scopes, UI tab removal)</td><td style="background:#fff8e1"><strong>smoke-after-delete</strong></td><td style="background:#fff8e1">No red-first — delete then smoke</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Docs-only, plan-only, or comment-only</td><td style="background:#fff8e1"><strong>smoke-after-delete</strong></td><td style="background:#fff8e1">Lint/snapshot if any; no TDD ceremony</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

When ambiguous, default **`strict-TDD`** and note the assumption in the plan Decision log.

