<h2 id="onlyreftdd-chain" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Chain links</h2>

| Chain | Plan | Implement / resume |
|-------|------|-------------------|
| **1 Classic** | **`onlyref`** | **`aciub`** + **`implref`** / **`resumimpl`** |
| **2 TDD (this chain)** | **`onlyreftdd`** | **`aciubtdd`** + **`implreftdd`** |

| TDD rule | Path |
|----------|------|
| Implement loop | `.cursor/rules/tdd/aciubtdd-allow-continue-iterations-until-blocked.mdc` |
| Impl procedure | `.cursor/rules/tdd/implreftdd-resumimpl-refactor-plan-followthrough.mdc` |

**Do not mix chains** on one refactor (e.g. **`onlyreftdd`** plan + **`aciub`** execution).

